# Momin Agro (মোমিন এগ্রো) - Supabase Environment Configuration Example
# Copy this file to '.env' or '.env.local' and provide your actual Supabase project credentials.
#
# IMPORTANT:
# - Only provide your Supabase Project URL and Anon (Public) Key.
# - NEVER place your Supabase service_role key, database password, or server secrets here.
# - The application will run in honest Demo Mode ("নমুনা তথ্য") when these keys are unconfigured.

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-id.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-supabase-anon-key-here
